yy
Start with small doses (e.g. total daily dose of 6-10 units) of NPH 
insulin or premixed insulin (which has 30% of regular and 70% of 
NPH insulin), subcutaneously.
yy
Give approximately two-thirds of the total daily dose before breakfast 
and one-third before dinner.
yy
Adjust the insulin doses before breakfast and/or dinner by plus or 
minus 2 units according to results of blood glucose tests.
yy
Monitor insulin therapy with 2-4 weekly FBS (and 2-hour post-
