SEPTIC ABORTION
This is a life threatening complication of abortion. Most often 
there is a history of criminal interference with the pregnancy.  It may 
lead to complications such as septic shock, uterine damage, peritonitis, 
haemorrhage, disseminated intravascular coagulation (DIC), acute renal 
failure, adult respiratory distress syndrome, tetanus or gas gangrene.
