cancer drug reaction (cyclophosphamide) radiation cystititis, parasite 
infestation (S. haematobium)
yy
Ureter: Infection, stone, tumour
yy
Kidney: Infection (pyelonephritis), stone, anatomic anomalies 
(Polycystic Kidney Disease, A-V Fistula) renal vein or artery 
thrombosis,
yy
